THIRD-PARTY NOTE

The calibration tables are derived from the public iPinYou dataset
(Zhang, Yuan, Wang et al., "Real-Time Bidding Benchmarking with iPinYou
Dataset", 2014). Only aggregated distribution shapes are redistributed here; no
raw iPinYou records are included. Anyone regenerating these tables from the raw
logs, via scripts/calibrate_ipinyou.py, is bound by iPinYou's own terms.
